aragraph_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p004","quote":"景徽","mention_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p004:m0105"},{"work_id":"w-beishi","book_id":"b-beishi-044","chapter_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu","source_id":"s-beishi-044-cuidaogu-ws2183262","paragraph_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005","quote":"景徽","mention_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005:m0107"},{"work_id":"w-beishi","book_id":"b-beishi-044","chapter_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu","source_id":"s-beishi-044-cuidaogu-ws2183262","paragraph_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005","quote":"文睿","mention_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005:m0110"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"兩部北朝史傳記道固子景徽，字文叡／文睿，襲臨淄子、後任平州刺史，子休纂襲爵；與劉宋赴安都的景微／景徵是否同人待核。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","source_assertion_id":"a-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-m0341-p04-m0033-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004","quote":"皇興初，顯祖詔征南大將軍慕容白曜固築長圍以守之。及白曜攻其城東郭，道固面縛請罪，表曰：「臣資生南境，限隔大化，本朝不以卑末，委授藩任。而劉氏蕭牆內侮，懼貽大戮，前遣崔啟之奉表歸誠，幸蒙陛下過垂矜納，并賜爵寵，慶佩罔極，應奔闕庭。但劉彧尋續遣使，恕臣百死。愚以世奉劉氏，深愆蒙宥，若猶違背，則是不忠於本朝，而欲求忠於大魏。雖曰希生，懼大魏之所不許。是用迷回，孤負天日，冒萬死之艱，固執拒守。僕臣白曜，振曜威靈，漸經二載，大將臨城，以今月十四日，臣東郭失守，於臣款彧之誠，庶可以彰於大魏矣。臣勢窮力屈，以十七日面縛請罪，白曜奉宣皇恩，恕臣生命。斯實陛下起臣死尸，肉臣朽骨，天地造物所不能行，而陛下育之。雖虞舜之貸有苗，姬文之宥崇壘，方之聖澤，未足以喻。既未奉朝旨，無由親馳道路，謹遣大息景徽，束骸歸闕，伏聽刑斧。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0341","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0033","source_term":"大息景徽"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"道固自述「大息」以稱長子。"}},{"id":"23q_wcp_hny_BA","label":"崔休纂","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"休纂","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p007:m0071","c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005:m0125"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","chapte